Grammar

    0 $accept: prog $end

    1 prog: let

    2 let: LET decs IN expseq END

    3 decs: decs dec
    4     | ε

    5 dec: tydec
    6    | vardec
    7    | fundec

    8 tydec: TYPE ID EQ ty

    9 ty: ID
   10   | LBRACE tyfields RBRACE
   11   | ARRAY OF ID

   12 tyfields: ID COLON ID tyfields
   13         | COMMA tyfields
   14         | ε

   15 vardec: VAR ID ASSIGN exp
   16       | VAR ID COLON ID ASSIGN exp

   17 fundec: FUNCTION ID LPAREN tyfields RPAREN EQ expseq
   18       | FUNCTION ID LPAREN tyfields RPAREN COLON ID EQ expseq

   19 lvalue: ID
   20       | lvalue DOT ID
   21       | lvalue LBRACK exp RBRACK

   22 math: LPAREN exp RPAREN
   23     | exp PLUS exp
   24     | exp MINUS exp
   25     | exp TIMES exp
   26     | exp DIVIDE exp

   27 boolexp: boolexp AND boolexp
   28        | boolexp OR boolexp
   29        | exp bool exp

   30 bool: EQ
   31     | NEQ
   32     | LT
   33     | LE
   34     | GT
   35     | GE

   36 fparams: COMMA fparams
   37        | IF boolexp THEN exp ELSE exp
   38        | exp
   39        | ε

   40 valess: ID LPAREN fparams RPAREN
   41       | lvalue ASSIGN exp
   42       | IF boolexp THEN expseq ELSE expseq
   43       | IF boolexp THEN expseq
   44       | WHILE boolexp DO expseq
   45       | FOR ID ASSIGN exp TO exp DO expseq
   46       | BREAK

   47 expseq: LPAREN expseq RPAREN
   48       | expseq SEMICOLON expseq
   49       | valess
   50       | ε

   51 exp: math
   52    | ID LBRACK exp RBRACK OF exp
   53    | lvalue
   54    | INT
   55    | STRING


